Review this code and rewrite it if you can make it better. It runs on every invoice email.

```js
const triage = await ask_jev({ state: { invoice, email }, questions: { dispute: { type: 'noul', instructions: 'Does `email` dispute a charge on `invoice`?' } } })
if (triage.dispute.noul > 0.8) {
  const detail = await ask_jev({ state: { invoice, email }, questions: { which_line: { type: 'choice', instructions: 'Which line of `invoice` does `email` dispute?', criteria: { L1: 'line 1', L2: 'line 2', L3: 'line 3' } } } })
  creditLine(detail.which_line.choice)
}
const docs = await ask_jev({ state: { invoice, email }, questions: { wants_document: { type: 'noul', instructions: 'Does `email` ask for a W-9, receipt, or timesheet?' } } })
if (docs.wants_document.noul > 0.8) sendDocuments()
```

Write the improved ask_jev call or calls, then two lines on what changed and why.
